    "Raw compiler/build-output captures, complete runtime/source manifests and privately owned execution controllers remain immutable at original finite locations referenced by delivery receipts. These development results do not renew any final qualification epoch.",
    "Five source-complete journal routes now require every named parent/child and original six-platform source/run/attempt/archive/uploader outcome. Eight focused authority methods pass with236 missing/SKIP,48 identity and30 platform omission vectors. Original missing-route RED and initial malformed negative fixture are retained; no runtime qualification.",
    "Actual local inert Node24 capture recognized83 stopped-instruction frames across12threads using inbox DLLs, detached with HRESULT0/network-off policy and preserved owned running identity. First private quoted-argv guard setup and alias precondition failures retained. No Pi/Node22 exit cause or natural-exit qualification claim."
